# 10x Change Workflow

This repo follows the 10xDevs AI Toolkit. Skills are in `.cursor/skills/`.

When a task matches a skill below, read and follow the full `SKILL.md` for that skill before acting.

## Context paths

- `context/foundation/` — PRD, tech stack, lessons (read-only hand-offs; do not edit without the matching skill)
- `context/changes/<change-id>/` — active change (`change.md`, `plan.md`, reviews)
- `context/archive/` — immutable; refuse to modify. Say: "This change is archived. Open a new change with 10x-new instead."

## Skill router

| When | Skill |
| --- | --- |
| Scaffold `/context` for the first time | `10x-init` |
| New product idea → shape notes | `10x-shape` |
| Shape notes → PRD | `10x-prd` |
| PRD → roadmap slices | `10x-roadmap` |
| Pick stack (greenfield) | `10x-tech-stack-selector` |
| Assess existing stack (brownfield) | `10x-stack-assess` |
| Scaffold repo after stack pick | `10x-bootstrapper` |
| Deployment platform research | `10x-infra-research` |
| Project health audit | `10x-health-check` |
| Challenge problem framing before planning | `10x-frame` |
| Deep codebase research | `10x-research` |
| Start a new change folder | `10x-new` |
| Write implementation plan | `10x-plan` |
| Review a plan before coding | `10x-plan-review` |
| Execute `plan.md` (complex / phased) | `10x-implement` |
| Review code against plan | `10x-impl-review` |
| Capture recurring team rule | `10x-lesson` |
| Archive completed change | `10x-archive` |
| Generate or refresh `AGENTS.md` | `10x-agents-md` |
| Review AI rules files | `10x-rule-review` |

## Invocation

Name the skill in chat (e.g. `use 10x-implement`) or attach `@.cursor/skills/<name>/SKILL.md`. For simple, bounded tasks with a clear stop condition, work autonomously toward the stated goal without requiring the full phased `10x-implement` ceremony.

## Parallel work

- One change per worktree or isolated workspace; one fresh agent context per change.
- Parallelism is capped by review capacity — more agents without review means more unreviewed code.
